see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/gen_literals.vox".
see "../src/gen_manifest.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".

(The ledger's file leaves, batch B - docs/ledger/files.md rows FIL-01,
 FIL-02, FIL-03, FIL-04, FIL-05, FIL-06, FIL-07, FIL-40, FIL-46.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself -
 the same shape as 300_gen_buffers_a.vox. Emitted twice per leaf: at
 the true top level (nested false) and inside a block (nested true),
 the two ways 'gen join lines' can render a line.

 These leaves write a file, which interpolates the scratch flag's name -
 a live program gets that from its manifest; this test names one
 itself, the same as 300_gen_buffers_a.vox does.)
Set gen_scratch_flag to "'the workspace'".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.

Print "--- FIL-01: size is live, 0 before a write and the byte count after ---".
'rng seed' of 11.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file size' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 11.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file size' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-02: descriptor is a Number, at least 3 ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file descriptor' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-03, FIL-04: readable/writable per drawn mode - reading ---".
'rng seed' of 4.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file readable writable' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-03, FIL-04: writing ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file readable writable' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-03, FIL-04: appending ---".
'rng seed' of 7.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file readable writable' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-05, FIL-06: modified/accessed, bounded both sides ---".
'rng seed' of 9.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file times' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-07: permissions is 420 on a fresh file ---".
'rng seed' of 6.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file permissions' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-40: appending adds to the end, size is N+M ---".
'rng seed' of 15.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file appending' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-46: Read line replaces, not appends ---".
'rng seed' of 21.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf read line replaces' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- FIL-46, nested ---".
'rng seed' of 21.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf read line replaces' of "  " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

(A program that never committed to file I/O was never given a path, so
 every leaf above must stand aside for the plain-print leaf instead of
 inventing one - the same guarantee 'gen leaf buffer truncation' gives
 in 300_gen_buffers_a.vox.)
Print "--- every leaf above with no file I/O committed ---".
Set gen_does_file_io to false.
'rng seed' of 11.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file size' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
'rng seed' of 15.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf file appending' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
'rng seed' of 21.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf read line replaces' of "" and false.
Print "emits a file open: {'gen text contains' of \"open a file\"}".
Set gen_does_file_io to true.
